    "rich_text_LgPpjG": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_ccnJPt": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Corporate & Community Engagement - \"Design Your Own Experience\"",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_WY8YBV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>Organizations partner with Rebel Nell to give their constituents a one-of-a-kind experience. Some companies have materials in mind to create unique keepsake pieces, others want to bring their audience into the event and together craft the personalized elements for a take-home item. We are excited to help determine what is best for your audience!</p><p>Our \"Design Your Own\" Experience combines art, impact, and sustainability to create a truly memorable engagement opportunity. Whether using repurposed graffiti, meaningful materials from your organization, or remnants from our custom mural-making experiences, guests can craft personalized keepsakes that tell a unique story. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_ccnJPt",
        "text_WY8YBV"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "custom_class_btn": "",
        "align_text": "center",
        "narrow_column": false,
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "divider": false
      }
    },
    "text_columns_cVEKqp": {
      "type": "text-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_wrJNrz": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/sxsw.png",
            "image_mask": "portrait",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "",
            "text": "",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_FBYrxg": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": false,
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "Experiential Activation",
            "text": "<p>Whether a group of 10 or 10,000, your attendees participate in a interactive activity that builds community and gives people the opportunity to more deeply engage with one another or your brand.</p><h4><strong>HOW IT WORKS</strong></h4><p><strong>Step 1</strong> - Work with the Rebel Nell team to determine the \"meaningful materials\" for your organization's custom pieces. It can be anything from our signature material, graffiti, to grass from a golf course - the options are endless!</p><p><strong>Step 2 </strong>- You choose what item(s) you want for your custom keepsake pieces from our robust catalog. Examples include - golf divot tools, key chains, label pins, wine bottle stoppers, jewelry, and much more!</p><p><strong>Step 3 </strong>- On the day of your event, our team is on site to make the magic happen!</p><p></p>",
            "button_label": "Get Started Now!",
            "button_link": "https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/rebel-nell-experinces-contact-us-form"
          }
        }
      },
