        "title": "Albion Collage Graduation",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<p>The senior class could created commemorative college jewelry made from either the campus rock or the \"senior sheet\", that all seniors contribute to during the year, sharing their memories of the experience at Albion.</p>",
