        "title": "Ally Bank Lapel Pins",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<p>Ally Financial and the Detroit Pistons along with their fans created a special Rebel Nell mural to recognize the importance of empowering females from all walks of life. The remnants of the mural were used to create custom 313 pins and gifted to members of the She-313 Program as a reminder that you are strong, powerful, and deserving.</p>",
