    "testimonials_zMmpUk": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_rMjCYG": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>From concept to execution, Rebel Nell has been a wonderful mission-driven partner for the Detroit Red Wings and Detroit Tigers organizations in support of elevating opportunities and access for women and children in Detroit. Rebel Nell's agility and unconventional approach to jewelry-making provides our fans with unique, one-of-a-kind keepsakes they will cherish forever. More importantly, each purchase unlocks the power of potential for so many who benefit from the proceeds.<br/><br/></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Ilitich_Charities_Divot_Tool_Website_White_Background.png",
            "author": "Kevin Brown",
            "author_info": "Director, Community Impact, Detroit Red Wings & Detroit Tigers"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_97Ci6J": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>Rebel Nell is so fun and easy to work with. I always look forward to our collaboration meetings because I know I will walk away inspired, excited for our next project, and with ideas for 10 more projects! Their products are top-notch, and the collaboration process, from idea to physical product, is effortless. Working with Rebel Nell, who is doing so much good in the Detroit community, has been a great partnership for us.<br/></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC08828.jpg",
            "author": "Kevin Brehmer",
            "author_info": "Director of Operations & Merchandise, Detroit City Football Club"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_RW8w4q": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>S3 has worked with Rebel Nell on many customized pieces over the years and in every case, it was a great experience every time. Not only do our employees love their gifts, but everyone at S3 has gotten to know Rebel Nell and the important and impactful work they do in the community. They are true partners to S3 in every sense. We're proud to wear Rebel Nell!</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/S3I_Jayson_2.jpg",
            "author": "Cindy Pasky",
            "author_info": "Founder, President & CEO Strategic Staffing Solutions"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_4eV4xf": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>Avalon Healing Center has thoroughly enjoyed partnering with Rebel Nell on our custom collection – both of our organizations share a common mission of engaging and empowering those in our community. The product that they made for Avalon is beautiful, on brand and truly unique. Our donors love it and it has also provided a great fundraising opportunity for us.<br/><br/></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_5626.jpg",
            "author": "Trinea Gonczar",
            "author_info": "Director of Development, Avalon Healing Center"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "testimonial_rMjCYG",
        "testimonial_97Ci6J",
        "testimonial_RW8w4q",
        "testimonial_4eV4xf"
      ],
